{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_07497","headline":"小鸟篇上裴尹 · 刘长卿","name":"小鸟篇上裴尹","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"藩篱小鸟何甚微，翩翩日夕空此飞。\n只缘六翮不自致，长似孤云无所依。\n西城黯黯斜晖落，衆鸟纷纷皆有托。\n独立虽轻燕雀羣，孤飞远惧鹰鸇搏。\n自怜天上青云路，吊影徘徊独愁暮。\n衔花纵有报恩时，择木谁容托身处。\n岁月蹉跎飞不进，羽毛鹪顇何人问。\n遶树空随乌鹊惊，巢林只有鹪鹩分。\n主人庭中荫乔木，爱此清阴欲栖宿。\n少年挟弹遥相猜，遂使惊飞往复回。\n不辞奋翼向君去，唯怕金丸随後来。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"刘长卿","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_07497.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_07497","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}